# =============================================================================
# ai-mcp — MCP server for a sandboxed workspace
#
# File:         mcp/.htaccess
# Purpose:      Stop Apache from serving the MCP server source and tests.
# Place:        mcp/.htaccess — Apache 2.4, applies only to the mcp/ folder.
# Version:      2.5.0
# Project:      ai-mcp
# Author:       Jor Teron
# Licence:      All rights reserved.
# Dependencies: Apache 2.4. The MCP process itself does not use Apache; it
#               listens on 127.0.0.1:10001. Other files under /home/www/ai
#               remain visible to Apache as usual.
# =============================================================================
Require all denied
